{
  "id": "lem-sfb-derived-lower-shriek-hom-iso",
  "kind": "statement",
  "title": "(Shriek) is an isomorphism when (Push) is one",
  "statement": "In the situation of [def-sfb-derived-lower-shriek-hom], if (Push) for the proper part $g$ of the\nchosen compactification of $f$ ([def-sfb-derived-push-hom]) is an isomorphism, then (Shriek)\n$T^Y\\circ Rf_!\\to Rf_!\\circ T^X$ is an isomorphism.",
  "source": {
    "document": "literature/blueprint/main-20261015/blueprint/sec-six-functors-basics/sk-def-sfb-coefficient-comparisons/lem-sfb-derived-lower-shriek-hom-iso.md",
