    "def-sfb-derived-push-hom"
  ],
  "proof": [
    {
      "text": "By [def-sfb-derived-lower-shriek-hom], (Shriek) is a composite of associativity isomorphisms,\nthe whiskering of (Push) for $g$ by $D(i_!)$, and the whiskering by $R(g_*)$ of the isomorphism\nof [def-sfb-derived-open-immersion-shriek-iso]. Whiskerings of isomorphisms are isomorphisms, so\nif (Push) for $g$ is an isomorphism, so is the composite.",
      "uses": [
        "def-sfb-derived-lower-shriek-hom",
        "def-sfb-derived-open-immersion-shriek-iso"
      ],
      "elementary": false
    }
  ],
